# Synced license-plate assets (~56 MB total); stored as normal blobs so CI/HF deploy
# clones don't require GitHub LFS (HF deploy strips binaries from the Space push anyway).
# Last so it wins: in .gitattributes the later matching line overrides the earlier one, and the *.png / *.jpg
# LFS lines above would otherwise reclaim these files and show them as modified in every checkout.
web_app/public/wikicommons/** -filter -diff -merge

# The README's pitch-deck cover (~100 KB): a normal blob so it renders on GitHub and can be committed from sessions
# that can't upload LFS objects. Last so it wins over the *.png LFS line above.
web_docs/static/img/deck-cover.png -filter -diff -merge

# Marts ERD PNGs: one normal-sized diagram per subject area (#614). Plain blobs so a checkout can preview them
# without git-lfs (the old single-canvas PNGs were LFS pointers and unopenable). Last so it wins over *.png above.
web_docs/static/img/erd/** -filter -diff -merge

# Small site icons, logos and bug screenshots committed as normal blobs (#257). Kept plain so a checkout matches the
# commit (otherwise git status lists them as modified and `git add -A` moves them into LFS) and sessions that can't
# upload LFS objects can still commit next to them. Last so they win over the *.png / *.jpg / *.svg / *.ico lines above.
